H('484.d.12.C',4,"Drug diversion by an employee puts patients at risk because the missing drug may leave them without:","treatment",["ice","signs","paper"],"Patients may not receive medicine.")
H('484.d.12.D',3,"One way to minimize diversion is to keep controlled substances locked and perform regular:","inventory counts",["parties","paint jobs","raffles"],"Counts detect loss.")
H('484.d.12.D',4,"Requiring two people to witness the destruction of a controlled substance is an example of a:","safeguard",["discount","stunt","delay tactic"],"Witnessing prevents theft.")
